# Conclusions in git; evidence and scratch stay on disk.
# Allowlist: nothing in .qa-loop/ is tracked unless named below. A new durable
# output type gets its exact name added here, deliberately — never `git add -f`
# around this file. Patterns are exact/dash-prefixed on purpose, so Finder
# duplicates ("REPORT 2.md") and stray scratch stay untracked by default.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!REPORT.md
!REPORT-*.md
!rounds.md
!rounds-*.md
!ledger.json
!ledger-*.json
!coverage.json
!verdict.json
!HARNESS_NOTES.md
!HARNESS_NOTES-*.md
!harness-notes-*.md
!TESTCASES.md
!WORKFLOWS.md
!tools/*
# The scriptable XCUITest driver (source + client + launcher; the generated xcodeproj and
# DerivedData are rebuilt by start.sh and stay on disk).
!driver/
!driver/project.yml
!driver/qa.py
!driver/start.sh
!driver/stop.sh
!driver/README.md
!driver/Sources/
!driver/Sources/*.swift
__pycache__/
